graph TB
    %% Wrfcoin Database Schema Overview

    CORE["🗂️ Core Blockchain Operations<br/>8 tables"]
    GOVERNANCE["🗂️ Governance & Voting System<br/>6 tables"]
    REWARDS["🗂️ Achievements & Economic Incentives<br/>4 tables"]
    IOT["🗂️ Environmental & Sensor Data<br/>5 tables"]
    CROSSCHAIN["🗂️ Cross-Chain Operations<br/>3 tables"]
    USERS["🗂️ User, Wallets, and Identity<br/>2 tables"]

    %% Inter-schema relationships
    CORE --> REWARDS
    USERS --> REWARDS
    IOT --> CORE
    CROSSCHAIN --> CORE
    GOVERNANCE --> USERS
    ANALYTICS --> CORE
    ORACLE --> CORE
